a golden retriever puppy.

00:08:56.367 --> 00:08:57.934
[ Awws, cheering,
and applause ]

00:08:57.934 --> 00:08:59.367
-That's the way it works.

00:08:59.367 --> 00:09:02.667
-If you answer incorrectly,
your opponent gets the puppy.

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:05.167
[ Awws ]
And whoever has the most puppies

00:09:05.167 --> 00:09:07.400
