00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.901
[ Awws ]
is the Pup Quiz champion.

00:09:08.901 --> 00:09:11.501
Keanu, since you're our guest,
you'll answer the first question

00:09:11.501 --> 00:09:15.400
and either win or lose
Mr. Gary Frick Jr.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.767
-Okay.

00:09:16.767 --> 00:09:19.634
-What is the only species
of reptile --

